    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-γνώμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
